      ],
      "source": "https://discoverpuertorico.info/destinations/arecibo/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cueva Ventana, a cliff‑side cave overlooking the Rio Grande de Arecibo valley, is a popular spot for hikers and photographers.",
